closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-02-16T17:57:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T22:50:10Z","closed_at":"2026-06-29T20:19:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102923","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102923.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102923.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-29T20:19:15Z"},"body":"Ensure minimum scrolling and maximum visibility in a single axis.\r\n\r\nWhen there is only one `ScrollContainer`, it behaves the same as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100695#issuecomment-2645755492. Add unit tests for this case.\r\n\r\nFor the case where `ScrollContainer` nesting exists, due to the occlusion of the internal `ScrollContainer`, the control may not be visible. \r\n\r\nThe `ScrollContainer` with **follow focus** enabled will automatically adjust its own scroll value when the control is focused. The scrolling of each level of `ScrollContainer` needs to be considered during calculation.\r\n\r\nTODO: For the case of rotation, it may be an edge case. Since the resulting `Rect2` may be enlarged after applying the rotation transformation, the resulting intersection `Rect2` is not accurate enough. The result may not be ideal in some extreme cases.\r\n\r\n| | In ScrollContainer space | In control space |\r\n| :----: | :------: |  :------: | \r\n|Image| ![001](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04123905-8739-487f-9d2d-315de386c1d0) |  ![002](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2e2ea3a-b4db-4a09-91be-632c5ab49bee) | \r\n|The intersection rect| ABFG  |A'B'C'D|\r\n| The ideal intersection rect | CEHI | DHJI |\r\n\r\n\r\n`ScrollContainer`'s border is red. The control's border is blue. The polygon of the intersection is DHI. The intersection rect is larger than the ideal one.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c